\n- **IV.** $x=5$\n- **V.** $x=6$\n- **VI.** $x=8$" :question/worked-solution "The determinant is $x^{2} + 10 x + 24$. Setting it equal to $8$ gives $\\left\\{-8, -2\\right\\}$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186060456 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059849 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ab642ad6-d9e0-5734-83b4-81627b9132eb" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for an Unknown Given the Determinant"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8c97d112-a733-50db-a3e0-14dc2721dcef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Any value of $k$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186059359} {:answer/id #uuid "a2aa1a94-21f1-552d-ae6c-c5b0802357bb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$10$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186059360} {:answer/id #uuid "b2d37c14-0ed6-5cb1-ae4d-65ca40ec7dab" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$0$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186059361} {:answer/id #uuid "0e5ddce2-efab-57ff-834e-5148be9476c7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$2$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186059362} {:answer/id #uuid "73493f5b-e7e5-53c5-91c5-a37d38ea1731" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$3$ and $-3$ only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186059363}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8c97d112-a733-50db-a3e0-14dc2721dcef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Any value of $k$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186059359} :answer-field/id #uuid "a3da1235-861c-5299-892e-dbd9ea51bf74" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186059358}] :question/id #uuid "aae8854c-5bc3-5b0c-a496-72765fde3229" :question/math-academy-id "q-9852" :question/problem "Find the possible values of the consta