ply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.\n\n- **I.** $x=-2$\n- **II.** $x=0$\n- **III.** $x=1$\n- **IV.** $x=2$" :question/worked-solution "After cancellation, $f(x)=\\frac{x - 10}{x^{2} - 4}$. Its real denominator zeros are $\\left\\{-2, 2\\right\\}$; canceled factors produce holes, not vertical asymptotes."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186088165 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087843 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "53b26ee4-53af-5660-a9e6-8e5cca8b3e1d" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating Vertical Asymptotes With Common Factors in the Numerator and Denominator"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7b1a90da-77cb-52b2-aa8a-030bc6d22c86" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439697} {:answer/id #uuid "662e1118-064e-5695-921f-917c73de42f7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439698}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "662e1118-064e-5695-921f-917c73de42f7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439698} :answer-field/id #uuid "5a7d20ac-f6df-52c2-bf29-6bbc8524ac13" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440206} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a437a75c-b730-5148-aabf-11e241718430" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439699} {:answer/id #uuid "883ac368-7765-5cb2-9ec1-fb437c0eaa9c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439700}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a437a75c-b730-5148-aabf-11e241718430" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #ed